{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19262","headline":"奉送裴司徒令公自东都留守再命太原 · 刘禹锡","name":"奉送裴司徒令公自东都留守再命太原","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"星使出关东，兵符赐上公。\n山河归旧国，管龠换离宫。\n行色旌旗动，军声鼓角雄。\n爱棠余故吏，骑竹见新童。\n汉垒三秋静，胡沙万里空。\n其如天下望，旦夕咏清风。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19262.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19262","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}